  "text_pages": [
    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Language Exchange\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nLanguage Exchange\nLanguage exchange program is designed for cultural and language sharing between exchange students and Korean students, with one exchange student paired with a group of four Korean students.\nUnlike the buddy program, this program simply lets you share your language and culture with the Korena students.\nEach team is required to meet at least five times during the semester. Meal or activity expenses will be supported by the university.\nApplictation details will be provided at the beginnin g of the semester.\nThis is a very popular program among Korean students, so we ask for your commitment and active participation.\nIt is a great opportunity to build meaningful frienships, and perhaps even a lifelong connection, with Korean friends.\nTeams with outstanding participation may receive a small prize.\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
